1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:05,040
Buying one AI image means a signup and a card on file.

2
00:00:05,930 --> 00:00:09,690
Gliana Agent. Pay per result, from your own wallet.

3
00:00:10,470 --> 00:00:14,070
The home screen is a map, drawn by the product itself.

4
00:00:15,430 --> 00:00:17,830
One box reaches every model we sell.

5
00:00:20,430 --> 00:00:24,910
The agent picks one and quotes the price. Eighteen cents.

6
00:00:25,930 --> 00:00:31,370
Not only generation. Fifty tools, priced the same way.

7
00:00:31,590 --> 00:00:34,230
On a phone, the camera is the prompt.

8
00:00:36,930 --> 00:00:42,370
Today's quest leads: your machine, transformed into a robot.

9
00:00:42,930 --> 00:00:46,370
The price comes first. Four point eight cents.

10
00:00:48,930 --> 00:00:51,490
One approval, signed in Seed Vault.

11
00:00:52,130 --> 00:00:58,530
The photograph comes back transformed. Same table, same curtain, same cable.

12
00:01:02,130 --> 00:01:06,290
Now stake it. One global round a day, on Solana mainnet.

13
00:01:10,130 --> 00:01:15,570
Entry is five SKR, or four if you hold a hundred. The chain checks.

14
00:01:19,130 --> 00:01:21,210
The wallet shows the same numbers.

15
00:01:21,730 --> 00:01:27,810
You are in. The pot is nineteen SKR, held by the round's own vault.

16
00:01:30,730 --> 00:01:38,410
Four machines transformed. A fan, a rice cooker, a motorbike, and yours.

17
00:01:39,730 --> 00:01:43,490
Voting is free. One per wallet, enforced on chain.

18
00:01:48,730 --> 00:01:52,970
Payouts are permissionless. The pot pays out even if we disappear.

19
00:01:53,730 --> 00:01:56,370
It is live on the Solana dApp Store today.
